<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Figtree:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
      type="text/css"
    />
    <title>PadiPlus</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        min-height: 100vh;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .email-container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .header-banner {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745, #20c997);
        padding: 30px 0;
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .header-banner::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: -50%;
        left: -50%;
        width: 200%;
        height: 200%;
        background: radial-gradient(
          circle,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 1px,
          transparent 1px
        );
        background-size: 30px 30px;
        animation: float 20s infinite linear;
      }

      @keyframes float {
        0% {
          transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg);
        }
        100% {
          transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(360deg);
        }
      }

      .success-icon {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: 0 auto 20px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .success-icon svg {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        color: white;
      }

      .logo-section {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .logo {
        max-height: 60px;
        width: auto;
      }

      .email-content {
        padding: 40px;
      }

      .admin-badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
        color: white;
        padding: 8px 16px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .admin-badge svg {
        width: 16px;
        height: 16px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: #28a745;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }

      h3 {
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .description {
        color: #5a6c7d;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .passkey-section {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa, #e9ecef);
        border: 2px solid #e9ecef;
        border-radius: 15px;
        padding: 25px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .passkey-section::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: -100%;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          transparent,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4),
          transparent
        );
        animation: shimmer 3s infinite;
      }

      @keyframes shimmer {
        0% {
          left: -100%;
        }
        100% {
          left: 100%;
        }
      }

      .passkey-title {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #495057;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .passkey-title svg {
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        color: #6366f1;
      }

      .passkey-code {
        font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #2c3e50;
        background: white;
        padding: 15px 25px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 2px dashed #dee2e6;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        margin: 15px 0;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .passkey-note {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #6c757d;
        font-style: italic;
        margin-top: 10px;
      }

      .action-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745, #20c997);
        color: white;
        padding: 16px 40px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.3);
        margin: 20px 0;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }

      .action-button:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.4);
      }

      .security-notice {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3cd, #ffeaa7);
        border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 25px 0;
      }

      .security-notice h4 {
        color: #856404;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .security-notice h4 svg {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
      }

      .security-notice p {
        color: #856404;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .footer-section {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 25px 40px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer-text {
        color: #6c757d;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .footer-links {
        margin-top: 15px;
      }

      .footer-links a {
        color: #28a745;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin: 0 15px;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .footer-links a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .email-content {
          padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 1.8rem;
        }

        .passkey-code {
          font-size: 1.4rem;
          padding: 12px 20px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <!-- Success Header Banner -->
      <div class="header-banner">
        <div class="success-icon">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="logo-section">
          <img src="<%= logoUrl %>" alt="PadiPlus Logo" class="logo" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="email-content">
        <!-- Admin Badge -->
        <div class="admin-badge">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <%= adminType %> Account
        </div>

        <h1>Email Successfully Verified!</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          Your admin account is now active and ready to use
        </p>

        <h3>Hello <%= name %>,</h3>

        <p class="description">
          Congratulations! Your email address has been successfully verified and
          your <%= adminType.toLowerCase() %> account is now fully activated.
          You now have access to all administrative features and can begin
          managing the platform.
        </p>

        <!-- Unique Passkey Section -->
        <div class="passkey-section">
          <div class="passkey-title">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            Your Unique Admin Passkey
          </div>
          <div class="passkey-code"><%= uniquePasskey %></div>
          <p class="passkey-note">
            Save this passkey securely - you can use it to reset your password
            if needed
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Security Notice -->
        <div class="security-notice">
          <h4>
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.864-.833-2.634 0L4.168 15.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            Important Security Information
          </h4>
          <p>
            <strong>Keep your passkey confidential.</strong> This unique
            identifier grants administrative access to your account. Never share
            it with unauthorized persons and store it in a secure location.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="description">
          As a <%= adminType.toLowerCase() %>, you have elevated privileges
          within the platform. Please use these responsibly and in accordance
          with your organization's policies.
        </p>

        <a
          href="<%= dashboardUrl %>"
          style="
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745, #20c997);
            color: white;
            padding: 16px 40px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.3);
            margin: 20px 0;
          "
        >
          Access Admin Dashboard
        </a>

        <p
          style="
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 30px;
            text-align: center;
          "
        >
          Need help? Contact our support team at <%= supportEmail %>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer Section -->
      <div class="footer-section">
        <p class="footer-text">
          This email was sent to <%= email %> because you registered for a <%=
          adminType.toLowerCase() %> account with PadiPlus.
        </p>

        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="<%= privacyUrl %>">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="<%= termsUrl %>">Terms of Service</a>
          <a href="<%= helpCenterUrl %>">Support Center</a>
        </div>

        <p class="footer-text" style="margin-top: 20px">
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> PadiPlus • All rights reserved
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
